title Vinyl lists at 320x480: the browser, the queue (its buttons on two rows) and the output chooser
sizes 320x480
ppmm 667
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 800
key b
wait 300
shot p-browser
key q
wait 300
shot p-queue
expect text "Move down"
key esc
wait 200
key o
wait 300
shot p-output
expect noquit
